// Taylor Biggs, educated ogre proprietor of Tarant's Large & Tall Armour.
{1}{Welcome to Large & Tall Armour, where the sleeves reach the wrists, the breastplates reach the ribs, and dignity comes reinforced. Taylor Biggs, proprietor. How may I outfit you?}{Welcome to Large & Tall Armour, where the sleeves reach the wrists, the breastplates reach the ribs, and dignity comes reinforced. Taylor Biggs, proprietor. How may I outfit you?}{}{}{}{ }
{2}{B:}{}{1}{}{20}{ }
{3}{What do you carry?}{}{1}{}{30}{ }
{4}{You speak like a university man.}{}{1}{}{40}{ }
{5}{That is quite a smoking jacket.}{}{1}{}{50}{ }
{6}{Farewell, Mr. Biggs.}{}{1}{}{0}{ }
{20}{By all means. Mind the shelving; it was designed by a halfling with an optimistic ruler.}{By all means. Mind the shelving; it was designed by a halfling with an optimistic ruler.}{}{}{}{ }
{21}{B:}{}{1}{}{20}{ }
{22}{Remind me what you specialize in.}{}{1}{}{30}{ }
{23}{I had another question.}{}{1}{}{1}{ }
{24}{That will be all.}{}{1}{}{0}{ }
{30}{Large armour, long coats, broad axes, proper hammers, and swords with the confidence to require both hands. I stock nothing described as dainty, petite, or merely decorative.}{Large armour, long coats, broad axes, proper hammers, and swords with the confidence to require both hands. I stock nothing described as dainty, petite, or merely decorative.}{}{}{}{ }
{31}{B:}{}{1}{}{20}{ }
{32}{How did you become such an educated merchant?}{}{1}{}{40}{ }
{33}{Back to my other questions.}{}{1}{}{1}{ }
{34}{Farewell.}{}{1}{}{0}{ }
{40}{A shelf of books is cheaper than a lifetime of being underestimated. Besides, invoices are relentless grammar tutors, and Tarant's tailors are merciless about punctuation.}{A shelf of books is cheaper than a lifetime of being underestimated. Besides, invoices are relentless grammar tutors, and Tarant's tailors are merciless about punctuation.}{}{}{}{ }
{41}{And the shop?}{}{1}{}{60}{ }
{42}{B:}{}{1}{}{20}{ }
{43}{Back to my other questions.}{}{1}{}{1}{ }
{44}{A sensible philosophy. Farewell.}{}{1}{}{0}{ }
{50}{Crimson smoking jacket, reinforced seams, and pockets deep enough for a ledger. An ogre may sell plate all day and still dress for dinner.}{Crimson smoking jacket, reinforced seams, and pockets deep enough for a ledger. An ogre may sell plate all day and still dress for dinner.}{}{}{}{ }
{51}{B:}{}{1}{}{20}{ }
{52}{Back to my other questions.}{}{1}{}{1}{ }
{53}{I cannot argue with that. Farewell.}{}{1}{}{0}{ }
{60}{I opened it after being told, for the hundredth time, that fine tailoring stopped at human proportions. Civilization is measured by many things; adequate shoulder room is among them.}{I opened it after being told, for the hundredth time, that fine tailoring stopped at human proportions. Civilization is measured by many things; adequate shoulder room is among them.}{}{}{}{ }
{61}{B:}{}{1}{}{20}{ }
{62}{Back to my other questions.}{}{1}{}{1}{ }
{63}{Well said. Farewell.}{}{1}{}{0}{ }
